        <details class="teaching-data"><summary>{t("Saved questions and review outcomes","保留问题与审查结果")}</summary><div class="teaching-scroll" tabindex="0" role="region" aria-label={t("Saved PaperQA review table","保留 PaperQA 审查表")}><table><caption>{t("Actual retained local software record, 2026-09-10; source questions are in English. This is not independent human grading.","实际保留的本地软件记录，2026-09-10；原问题为英文。这不是独立人工评分。")}</caption><thead><tr><th>{t("Question","问题")}</th><th>{t("Retained review verdict","保留审查结论")}</th></tr></thead><tbody>{paperqa.questions.map(question=><tr><th scope="row">{question.question}</th><td><code>{paperqa.source_review.find(review=>review.question_id===question.id)?.verdict}</code></td></tr>)}</tbody></table></div><p>{t("One extra-prose error is retained. The negative-control abstention retrieved only one Open Babel chunk, so it does not establish absence across two full papers. Recorded effective settings differed from the supplied base profile.","保留了一项多余文字错误。阴性对照弃答仅检索到一个 Open Babel 片段，因此不能建立两篇全文均不存在相关内容。记录的实际设置与提供的基础配置不同。")}</p></details>
      </div>}
      {track==="candidate-nomination"&&<div class="nomination-case">
        <div class="dossier-rule"><span>potency ≤ 50 nM</span><b>AND</b><span>selectivity ≥ 20</span><b>AND</b><span>exposure ≥ 3</span><b>AND</b><span>{t("reviewed safety + functional validation","已审查安全性与功能验证")}</span></div>
        <div class="nomination-actions">{dossier.map(candidate=><div><strong>{candidate.id}</strong><div class="nomination-gates"><span class="is-pass" title={t("Potency passes","Potency 达标")}>✓</span><b>∧</b><span class:list={{"is-pass":candidate.selectivity>=20,"is-fail":candidate.selectivity<20}} title={t("Selectivity","选择性")}>{candidate.selectivity>=20?"✓":"×"}</span><b>∧</b><span class:list={{"is-pass":candidate.exposure>=3,"is-fail":candidate.exposure<3}} title={t("Exposure","暴露")}>{candidate.exposure>=3?"✓":"×"}</span><b>∧</b><span class:list={{"is-missing":!candidate.safety}} title={t("Safety evidence requires review","安全性证据需要审查")}>{candidate.safety?"↗":"?"}</span></div><span>{candidate.selectivity<20?t("× Selectivity fails", "× 选择性未达标"):candidate.exposure<3?t("× Exposure fails", "× 暴露未达标"):t("? Safety evidence missing", "? 安全性证据缺失")}</span></div>)}</div>
        <div class="teaching-scroll" tabindex="0" role="region" aria-label={t("Constructed nomination dossier","构造提名档案")}><table class="dossier-matrix"><caption>{t("Constructed workbook case 5. Ratios are precomputed in compatible contexts; no universal thresholds are proposed.","构造工作簿案例 5。比值已在相容情境中预计算，不提出通用阈值。")}</caption><thead><tr><th>{t("Candidate","候选")}</th><th>{t("Potency, nM","Potency，nM")}</th><th>{t("Selectivity ratio","Selectivity ratio")}</th><th>{t("Exposure ratio","Exposure ratio")}</th><th>{t("Safety package","安全性包")}</th><th>{t("Function","功能")}</th></tr></thead><tbody>{dossier.map(candidate=><tr><th scope="row">{candidate.id}</th><td class="is-pass">✓ {candidate.potency}</td><td class:list={{"is-pass":candidate.selectivity>=20,"is-fail":candidate.selectivity<20}}>{candidate.selectivity>=20?"✓":"×"} {candidate.selectivity}</td><td class:list={{"is-pass":candidate.exposure>=3,"is-fail":candidate.exposure<3}}>{candidate.exposure>=3?"✓":"×"} {candidate.exposure}</td><td class:list={{"is-missing":!candidate.safety}}>{candidate.safety?t("Available for review","可供审查"):t("? Missing","? 缺失")}</td><td>{t("Interpretable","可解释")}</td></tr>)}</tbody></table></div>
        <p class="dossier-decision">{t("Complete rule: no candidate passes. Next action follows the failed or missing requirement, not an average rank.","完整规则：没有候选通过。下一行动取决于失败或缺失要求，而不是平均排名。")}</p>
